          "text": "The service is pretty limited - there's only one ferry leaving every evening in summer anyway, seven days a week - I'm not sure about the winter months. They may only run on four or five days then."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-7",
          "speaker": "Tammy",
          "text": "OK. So it's an overnight trip. I quite like that idea. Leaving at night and waking up as you arrive on the island. Can you remember how much you paid for your tickets?"
        },
