          "id": "p1-9",
          "speaker": "Tammy",
          "text": "Really? I was expecting it to be more like £400 during the peak season."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-10",
          "speaker": "Paul",
          "text": "So was I. It's great value. It's a good idea to book in advance because I think they get booked up quite quickly - especially during the school holidays."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-11",
          "speaker": "Tammy",
          "text": "Yes, I suppose so. I'm just not 100% sure of our plans yet. What if I had to cancel?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-12",
          "speaker": "Paul",
          "text": "That could be a problem. I don't think it's their policy to give refunds - just a voucher - which you can use at a later date. But you have to cancel a month in advance to get that."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-13",
          "speaker": "Tammy",
          "text": "Right. Well we need to make up our minds quickly then."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-14",
          "speaker": "Paul",
          "text": "You'd want to book a cabin too. We booked too late to get a cabin with a window. They're more expensive but much nicer than the inner cabins. You don't have to book a cabin at all but I think it's worth paying for. They also have luxury cabins, which are only for two people and have a TV - but I wouldn't bother with those."
