        {
          "id": "p4-6",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The researchers then looked at what impact the music had on the patients. They discovered that patients who had been played music reported feeling happier and more satisfied in the post-operative phase, and the length of their stay was shorter than for patients who had not listened to any music."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-7",
